---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Split from '../../components/Split.astro'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Care & Support | Pine Lake Covenant Church"
  description="Pastoral care, prayer, meals, and support around illness, grief, and hard seasons — for anyone who needs it."
>
  <div class="canvas">
    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="660105701_18200889916338056_3408852217555726193_n.jpg"
      alt="A leader talking warmly with someone at Pine Lake"
      tone="sand"
      reverse
      eyebrow="Care & Support"
    >
      <h1 class="display">Care &amp; Support</h1>
      <p class="subhead">Help and presence in hard seasons</p>
      <p class="lede">
        If you’re in a difficult season — illness, grief, family stress, or simply feeling overwhelmed — support at Pine
        Lake often begins quietly and personally. You don’t need to be a member, or to have it all figured out, to ask
        for help.
      </p>
    </Split>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What care usually looks like</h2>
      <p class="measure">
        Care here is simple and human: a conversation, prayer if that’s meaningful to you, practical help when life is
        heavy, and connection to people who can walk with you for a while.
      </p>
      <ul class="measure">
        <li>Pastoral care and prayer</li>
        <li>Meals and practical support during illness or crisis</li>
        <li>Support groups, including an Alzheimer’s caregivers group</li>
        <li>Care and presence around memorial services and times of loss</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="eyebrow">Specific ways we show up</p>
      <h2>Where to start</h2>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="card" href={`${base}for-our-neighbors/meals-of-care/`}>
          <h3>Meals of Care</h3>
          <p>Short-term meals during illness, recovery, a new baby, or grief.</p>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href={`${base}for-our-neighbors/stephen-ministry/`}>
          <h3>One-to-one care</h3>
          <p>A trained caregiver who will listen and walk alongside you, confidentially.</p>
        </a>

        <a class="card" href={`${base}for-our-neighbors/weddings-memorials/`}>
          <h3>Memorials &amp; loss</h3>
          <p>Support and presence around memorial services and seasons of grief.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>How to reach us</h2>
      <p class="measure">
        To ask for care — for yourself or on behalf of someone else — contact the church office. A member of our care
        team will follow up privately. Call <a href="tel:+14253928636">(425) 392-8636</a> or email
        <a href="mailto:office@plcc.org">office@plcc.org</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
